      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "This requires the NEW H3 Image workspace. It is NOT a workflow for the existing H3 Lab.\n\nPrompt is passed verbatim. No prompt builder, enhancer, hidden prefixes, negative prompt, Turbo or Akatz.\nNative MiniMax-H3-Image INT8 model, matching IMAGE VAE, six PDD steps, Euler.\nStart at 4 MP with few references; 16 MP is not an A40 memory guarantee.\nAspect source slot: 0 = first active picture; 3 = original upload slot 3. Only used when follow_image_1_aspect is ON.\nPicture tags follow ACTIVE slots in order. Disabled/empty slots are omitted. Check the report.\nLabels are reminders only. State head/body/scene roles yourself in your prompt.\nNative reference resizing can increase small references; lowering output MP alone does not cap all reference cost.\nThis is whole-image generation/editing, not exact background preservation or inpainting.\nThe original Lab and files under /workspace/h3-still are not modified.\nReports include actual vision/VAE reference sizes and sampling/decode time. Comparisons are resized previews, not the final image.\nYour results save under /workspace/h3-image/output/. No GPU inference has been validated by this package author."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "This requires the NEW H3 Image workspace. It is NOT a workflow for the existing H3 Lab.\n\nPrompt is passed verbatim. No prompt builder, enhancer, hidden prefixes, negative prompt, Turbo or Akatz.\nNative MiniMax-H3-Image INT8 model, matching IMAGE VAE, six PDD steps, Euler.\nStart at 4 MP with few references; 16 MP is not an A40 memory guarantee.\nAspect source slot: 0 = first active picture; 3 = original upload slot 3. Only used when follow_image_1_aspect is ON.\nPicture tags follow ACTIVE slots in order. Disabled/empty slots are omitted. Check the report.\nLabels are reminders only. State head/body/scene roles yourself in your prompt.\nNative reference resizing can increase small references; lowering output MP alone does not cap all reference cost.\nThis is whole-image generation/editing, not exact background preservation or inpainting.\nThe original Lab and files under /workspace/h3-still are not modified.\nReports include actual vision/VAE reference sizes and sampling/decode time. Comparisons are resized previews, not the final image.\nYour results save under /workspace/h3-image/output/. No GPU inference has been validated by this package author."
      }
